<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Sevel Q1 net loss $11.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Sevel Q1 net loss $11.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net loss $11.2 million vs N/A</p>
<p>Note: Sevel, which manufactures Peugeot cars under license, said the loss included an extraordinary loss of $9.2 million. Net assets of $374.2 million include retained earnings of $67.7 million. Other earnings or revenue data were not provided.</p>
<p>((-Gary Regenstreif, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618))</p>
